# OpenHands Workspace Directory

This directory is used by OpenHands for autonomous code execution.
Each job clones a repository into a subdirectory here.

Example structure:
```
workspace/
├── yourrepo1/
│   ├── src/
│   ├── package.json
│   └── .gate_results.log
├── yourrepo2/
│   └── ...
└── .gitkeep
```

**Note**: This directory is volume-mounted in Docker containers.
